, "y1": 0.12121212121212122}, {"text": "He follows the progress of one crest and notes that it arrives at the beach, a distance of 400m", "x0": 0.1, "y0": 0.12121212121212122, "x1": 0.8142857142857143, "y1": 0.1383061383061383}, {"text": "away, approximately 130 seconds after it passes him.", "x0": 0.1010989010989011, "y0": 0.13908313908313907, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.15384615384615385}, {"text": "Find the distance between the crests. 2", "x0": 0.1010989010989011, "y0": 0.16783216783216784, "x1": 0.8593406593406593, "y1": 0.1825951825951826}, {"text": "3. 076993077", "x0": 0.25054945054945055, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.3978021978021978, "y1": 0.29836829836829837}, {"text": "Question 27 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.35975135975135974, "x1": 0.2857142857142857, "y1": 0.372960372960373}, {"text": "\u2018The reverberation time for a room or concert hall is defined as the time it takes for a sound", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.3861693861693862, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.40093240093240096}, {"text": "to die down to one millionth of its original intensity.", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.40404040404040403, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.41647241647241645}, {"text": "Which room in a normal household is likely to have the longest reverberation time. 2", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.44755244755244755}, {"text": "Justify your decision.", "x0": 0.1076923076923077, "y0": 0.4522144522144522, "x1": 0.2703296703296703, "y1": 0.4654234654234654}, {"text": "Question 28 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11098901098901098, "y0": 0.6386946386946387, "x1": 0.29120879120879123, "y1": 0.6519036519036518}, {"text": "Outline one useful application of each of the reflective surfaces listed below.", "x0": 0.11208791208791209, "y0": 0.6666666666666666, "x1": 0.7021978021978021, "y1": 0.6814296814296814}, {"text": "a) Acconcave reflective surface", "x0": 0.11208791208791209, "y0": 0.6993006993006